# Two branches that each add an item to NEWS.md would conflict, because both
# add lines at the same place. "union" keeps the lines of both sides. It
# works when git merges or rebases on a machine. The merge button of GitHub
# does not read it. The tidyverse uses the same line (ggplot2, testthat,
# devtools). R CMD build leaves this file out by itself.
NEWS.md merge=union
